      "message": "fix(setup): generate 2D Offset, Trace and Engrave in an aligned setup\n\nThe three kinds take their region from region_for_job, the door that\nalready reads the part material, the heights and the picks in the setup\nframe. A new suite turns an L prism about X and then Z and proves that\neach kind cuts and posts the same program as the part with the turn\nbaked into its mesh, and a different path than the part as modelled.\n\nThe other kinds keep the refusal by name until a test proves them\n(docs/decisions/2276-aligned-setup-kinds.md lists each with its reason).\nThe two tests that used 2D Offset as the unverified example use Circular.\n\nRefs #2276\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
